%
%When I anger the gods - due to overpraying, then sacrifice
%at an alter, I get the message - "You have a feeling of 
%inadequacy".  No matter how many monsters I sacrifice, I
%still get that message.  I know the gods are mad at me,
%but how do I get in good with them again?

I experienced a similar problem.  I changed a literal (MAXVALUE) in pray.c
from 33 to 30 and this seemed to solve the problem without making praying
to the gods a "gimme".  It seems that the value used (33) is just a tad to
high so that it is literally impossible to appease the gods.  I have sent
this information to the development team.  I hope that they will agree and
change the value in the released source from 33 to 30.
